# Piper voices packaged as piper-voice-<lang>-<region>-<name>-<quality>.
# key (the sherpa-onnx release asset vits-piper-<key>.tar.bz2)   licence (SPDX)
# Only free licences; the rest of the 182 voices come from the downloader in
# xfce4-speech-settings. Left out: de_DE-kerstin-low and fr_FR-gilles-low (labelled
# CC0, but fine-tuned from en_US ryan, whose RyanSpeech data is CC BY-NC-SA 4.0);
# uk_UA-ukrainian_tts-medium (phoneme_type
# "text", not supported by sd_sherpa yet).
ru_RU-dmitri-medium     CC0-1.0
ru_RU-denis-medium      CC0-1.0
en_US-ljspeech-medium   public-domain
en_US-john-medium       public-domain
en_GB-alba-medium       CC-BY-4.0
de_DE-thorsten-medium   CC0-1.0
fr_FR-siwis-medium      CC-BY-4.0
es_ES-davefx-medium     CC0-1.0
it_IT-paola-medium      CC0-1.0
pl_PL-gosia-medium      CC0-1.0
pl_PL-darkman-medium    CC0-1.0
kk_KZ-issai-high        CC-BY-4.0
